{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12107","headline":"哭曹钧 · 钱起","name":"哭曹钧","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"苦节推白首，怜君负此生。\n忠荩名空在，家贫道不行。\n朝来相忆访蓬荜，只谓渊明犹卧疾。\n忽见江南吊鹤来，始知天上文星失。\n尝恨知音千古稀，那堪夫子九泉归。\n一声邻笛残阳里，酹酒空堂泪满衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12107.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12107","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}